{
  "title": "FútVal — métricas del backend",
  "uid": "futval-http-metrics",
  "tags": [
    "futval",
    "opcional"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 9,
  "refresh": "15s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Datasource",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "hide": 0,
        "current": {}
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Requests HTTP",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Latencia p95 por ruta (segundos)",
      "description": "histogram_quantile(0.95) sobre http_request_duration_seconds_bucket. Los streams (SSE) no entran al histograma.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 1
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, route) (rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tasa de error 5xx por endpoint",
      "description": "Por cada endpoint, respuestas 5xx sobre sus requests totales (http_requests_total). Es la tasa de error del SLA. Solo aparecen los endpoints que devolvieron algún 5xx; si no hay ninguno el panel queda vacío, que es lo esperado. Los 4xx no cuentan: son errores del cliente.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (route) (rate(http_requests_total{status_code=~\"5..\"}[5m])) / sum by (route) (rate(http_requests_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 14,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tasa de 4xx por endpoint",
      "description": "Por cada endpoint, respuestas 4xx sobre sus requests totales. Solo aparecen los endpoints que devolvieron algún 4xx; las rutas inexistentes salen como \"unmatched\". Es informativa: los 4xx son errores del cliente y no entran en la tasa de error del SLA (solo 5xx).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (route) (rate(http_requests_total{status_code=~\"4..\"}[5m])) / sum by (route) (rate(http_requests_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Proceso Node.js",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Uptime",
      "description": "Tiempo desde el arranque del proceso: time() - process_start_time_seconds. Vuelve a 0 en cada reinicio.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 19
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "time() - process_start_time_seconds",
          "legendFormat": "uptime"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU del proceso",
      "description": "Fracción de un núcleo usada por el proceso (rate de process_cpu_*_seconds_total). 100 % = un núcleo completo.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 10,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 19
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "stacking": {
              "mode": "normal",
              "group": "A"
            },
            "fillOpacity": 20
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "rate(process_cpu_user_seconds_total[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "usuario"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "rate(process_cpu_system_seconds_total[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "sistema"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Memoria",
      "description": "Memoria residente del proceso (RSS) y heap de V8 usado y reservado.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 10,
        "x": 14,
        "y": 19
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "process_resident_memory_bytes",
          "legendFormat": "RSS"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "nodejs_heap_size_total_bytes",
          "legendFormat": "heap reservado"
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "nodejs_heap_size_used_bytes",
          "legendFormat": "heap usado"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Event loop lag",
      "description": "Demora del event loop (p50 y p99). Valores sostenidos por encima de ~100 ms indican trabajo síncrono que bloquea las requests.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 27
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "nodejs_eventloop_lag_p50_seconds",
          "legendFormat": "p50"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "nodejs_eventloop_lag_p99_seconds",
          "legendFormat": "p99"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tiempo en GC",
      "description": "Fracción del tiempo que el proceso pasa en el garbage collector, por tipo (rate de nodejs_gc_duration_seconds_sum).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 27
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (kind) (rate(nodejs_gc_duration_seconds_sum[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{kind}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Handles y requests activos",
      "description": "Handles (sockets, timers, conexiones a la base) y requests de libuv activos. Un crecimiento sin techo sugiere una fuga.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 27
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "nodejs_active_handles_total",
          "legendFormat": "handles"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "nodejs_active_requests_total",
          "legendFormat": "requests"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 20,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Negocio",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 35
      },
      "panels": []
    },
    {
      "id": 21,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Operaciones por resultado",
      "description": "Operaciones de escritura de la API por resultado (business_operations_total): success = aceptada, rejected = rechazada por una regla de negocio, unexpected = fallida de forma inesperada. Para PLAYER_SYNC_TRIGGERED, success es \"corrida aceptada\", no \"corrida terminada\".",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 36
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (outcome) (rate(business_operations_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 22,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tokens y volumen por lado",
      "description": "Tokens operados (market_tokens_traded_total) y volumen en créditos (market_volume_credits_total), por compra (buy) y venta (sell). Solo cuentan operaciones efectivamente registradas.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 36
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (side) (rate(market_tokens_traded_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "tokens {{side}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (side) (rate(market_volume_credits_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "créditos {{side}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 23,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Rechazos por motivo",
      "description": "Órdenes de compra y venta rechazadas al crearse (market_order_rejections_total), por motivo. Mide solo el alta de órdenes: no incluye las cancelaciones. insufficient_balance y tokens_unavailable no tienen datos hoy: ningún error los produce todavía.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 44
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (reason) (increase(market_order_rejections_total[15m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{reason}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 24,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Operaciones por tipo",
      "description": "Tasa de cada operación de escritura de la API (business_operations_total), por tipo.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 16,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 44
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (operation) (rate(business_operations_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{operation}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 25,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Corridas de sync por fuente y resultado",
      "description": "Corridas de sincronización del último día (sync_runs_total): success = todas las unidades bien, partial = algunas fallaron, failure = se abortó o ninguna terminó bien.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 52
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (source, outcome) (increase(sync_runs_total[1d]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}} {{outcome}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 26,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Duración p95 de sync por fuente",
      "description": "Percentil 95 de la duración de las corridas de sincronización (sync_run_duration_seconds), por fuente.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 52
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, source) (rate(sync_run_duration_seconds_bucket[1d])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 27,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Antigüedad de la última sync exitosa",
      "description": "Tiempo desde la última corrida exitosa (success) de cada fuente: time() - sync_last_success_timestamp_seconds. Una corrida parcial o fallida no lo reinicia, así que un valor alto significa datos viejos. Sobrevive al reinicio del backend; una fuente sin ninguna corrida exitosa no aparece.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 52
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "time() - sync_last_success_timestamp_seconds",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 28,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Recálculos de cotización por origen y resultado",
      "description": "Recálculos del último día (quote_recalculations_total), por origen (scheduled o manual, incluida la simulación de mercado) y resultado.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 60
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (trigger, outcome) (increase(quote_recalculations_total[1d]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{trigger}} {{outcome}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 29,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Duración p95 del recálculo por origen",
      "description": "Percentil 95 de la duración de los recálculos de cotización (quote_recalculation_duration_seconds), por origen.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 60
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, trigger) (rate(quote_recalculation_duration_seconds_bucket[1d])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{trigger}}"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "bottom",
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi",
          "sort": "desc"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 30,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Alertas de precio disparadas",
      "description": "Alertas de precio disparadas en la última hora (alerts_triggered_total).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 68
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(increase(alerts_triggered_total[1h]))",
          "legendFormat": "alertas"
        }
      ],
